:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalertinit "orphanage">><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestCellar or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	走廊尽头的木门今天没有上锁。
门缝里吹出一股潮气，混着旧樟脑和湿石头的味道。
「昨晚贝利让人搬下去两只箱子，」<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>压低声音，「搬上来只有一只。」
你把耳朵贴近门板。里面没有人声，只有水一滴一滴落进铁桶。
	<br><br>
		<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[撬开木门 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧轻响">><<else>><<link [[撬开木门 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开木门">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<link [[问罗宾 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 1>><<set $mpTownCellarRobin to 1>><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[窥看门内 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 1>><<set $mpTownCellarPeek to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 4>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "门缝透光">>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
你回到走廊尽头。木门还虚掩着，门后的潮气比刚才更重。
	<br><br>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[下到地窖 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
你回到旧储物室的暗门前，指尖还留着石阶上的凉意。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[深入查看 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
账册残页还在你贴身的内袋里。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[翻查账册 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
你已经把残页上的名字对上了两处封印。铁皮箱还在木架后面。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[打开铁皮箱 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
铁皮箱的盖子已经被你撬松。楼上有人拖过一把椅子。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[取出末页 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
账册与收据都在你身上。走廊尽头传来贝利皮鞋踩过木地板的声响。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[退出暗门 (0:01)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
旧储物室已经被你翻查干净。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[回看暗门 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 2)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
门后是一段向下的窄梯，墙皮被水汽泡得发软。尽头有一盏没有点亮的煤油灯，灯座旁压着半盒受潮的火柴。
<<if $mpTownCellarRobin is 1>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>跟到楼梯口就停住了，手指绞着围裙角：「我在这儿听着。要是上面有人下来，我敲两下门框。」
<<elseif $mpTownCellarPeek is 1>>
	你刚才从门缝里看见的，是两只叠在一起的木箱和一条拖过地面的旧划痕。现在那条划痕就在你脚边。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[摸黑下行 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 6>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<stress 2>><<else>><<set $mpTownCellarNerve to 1>><<stress 5>><</if>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "石阶回声">>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[点亮油灯 (0:08)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 8>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 4>><</link>><<mpalertgain "灯芯亮起">>
<br>
<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[听下面动静 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpTownCellarListen to 1>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "屏住呼吸">>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
半地下的储藏室里码着旧床架、坏掉的木马和一摞发霉的床单。最里面那只木架与地面之间有一道半圆形的刮痕。
你刚把木架挪开半尺，头顶就传来脚步声。有人在走廊里停住了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-orphanage-cellar-step3">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "查看门锁 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-orphanage-cellar-step3">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 240>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_cellar_hidden"]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_hidden"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你缩进木架与墙之间的缝隙，把呼吸压到最浅。门缝里晃过一盏灯，灯光在石阶上停了一会儿，又慢慢移开。
	<<stress 2>><<mpalert -5>><<mpalertloss "缩进木架缝隙">>
木架后面露出一扇嵌在石墙里的橡木窄门，门锁上积着薄灰。
	<br><br>
<<link [[推开窄门 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 5>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "门轴轻响">>
	<br>
	<<link [[避开楼上人 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "贴墙屏息">>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownCellarNoise to 1>>
	你后退时膝盖撞上一只空铁桶。桶身滚过半圈，发出一声闷响。上面的脚步立刻加快，你只来得及躲到床架后面。
	<<stress 6>><<pain 2>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "铁桶滚响">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[凝目再查看门锁 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[查看门锁 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查看门锁">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
窄门后面是一间更小的石室。地上散着被撕碎的账页，墙角有一只铅封铁皮箱。你从碎纸里拼出半本收养登记册，纸页边缘用暗红墨水写着两个缩写：一个像学园的旧纹章，一个像神殿的蜡印。
<<if $mpTownCellarListen is 1>>
	你刚才听见的，是楼上有人在说「学园那边的旧档」。现在这句话和纸上的缩写对上了。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[比对学园纹章 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_cellar_school"]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_school"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<set $mpTownCellarLead to "school">><<pass 6>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "翻动碎纸">><<else>><<link [[比对学园纹章 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "比对学园纹章">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[比对神殿蜡印 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_cellar_temple"]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_temple"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<set $mpTownCellarLead to "temple">><<pass 6>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "翻动碎纸">><<else>><<link [[比对神殿蜡印 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "比对神殿蜡印">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[抄下人名 (0:08)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_cellar_names"]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_names"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<set $mpTownCellarLead to "names">><<pass 8>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "纸页窸窣">>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
铁皮箱的锁是老式的双排弹子。你蹲下去时，石室外面又传来一次脚步声，这次更近。
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_names"]>><span class="teal">你想起方才对上的院童编号，探针拨动双排弹子时心里格外有数。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-orphanage-cellar-step5">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link "拨开弹子 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-orphanage-cellar-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 650>><<set _reward to 450>><<elseif _sk gte 450>><<set _reward to 300>><<else>><<set _reward to 180>><</if>>
	锁舌轻轻弹开。箱里是几封匿名汇款单、一把黄铜小钥匙，还有一小卷用油纸包好的旧钞。
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_cellar_key")>>
		<<set $mpFragLedgerKey to ($mpFragLedgerKey or 0) + 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_cellar_receipts"]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_receipts"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<money _reward>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 8>><<mpalertgain "锁簧弹响">>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收好收据 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><<mpalert -8>><</link>><<mpalertloss "抹去指纹">>
	<br>
<<link [[再听暗门 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpTownCellarHeard to 1>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "屏息静听">>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownCellarCaught to 1>>
	锁芯卡住了。你用力一拧，铁皮箱里发出一声脆响，像是某根细簧断了。门外的人停下脚步，手已经搭上门把。
	<<stress 7>><<pain 2>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "细簧断裂">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[贴到门后 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<stress 2>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "贴到门后">>
	<br>
<<link [[开口应付 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 3>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "出声应答">>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拨开弹子 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拨开弹子">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestCellar or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownCellarCaught is 1>>
	门开了。贝利站在门口，手里提着一盏罩着黑布的灯。贝利没有立刻进来，只把灯举高，让光从你脸上慢慢移到身后的铁皮箱。
	「这么晚，」贝利说，「你在找什么？」
	<br><br>
<<mptailoricon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 250>><<link [[说找洗衣单 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 350>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "bluff">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_cellar_bluff"]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_bluff"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress 2>><<else>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "caught">><<stress 7>><<trauma 2>><</if>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 350>><<mpalert -10>><<else>><<mpalert 12>><</if>><</link>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 350>><<mpalertloss "装成洗衣仆役">><<else>><<mpalertgain "谎话被识破">><</if>><<else>><<link [[说找洗衣单 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "说找洗衣单">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[钻出煤槽 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "escape">><<pass 6>><<pain 3>><<stress 3>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "钻进煤槽阴影">>
	<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[交出账册 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "surrender">><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_school"] to 0>><<pass 3>><<stress 4>><<mpalert -8>><</link>><<mpalertloss "交出账册抹去痕迹">>
<<else>>
	你把账页、收据和黄铜小钥匙分开放进衣袋。暗门外传来贝利的声音，像是在跟谁交代「明天把旧储物室清空」。
	<<if $mpTownCellarHeard is 1>>
		你听见另一个更轻的声音应了一声。那是<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>。她说明天会把钟表铺后间的灯留到很晚。
		<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_cellar_sera"]>><<set $mpClues["town_cellar_sera"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<link [[交给罗宾 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "robin">><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -4>><<mpalert -12>><</link>><<mpalertloss "罗宾引开注意">><<else>><</if>>
	<br>
<<link [[留下账册 (0:04)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "keep">><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<link [[放回账册 (0:05)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownCellarOutcome to "return">><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -8>><</link>><<mpalertloss "放回账册抹去痕迹">>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestCellar to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
你把暗门恢复原状，从走廊尽头退出来。
<<if $mpTownCellarOutcome is "robin">>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>在楼梯口等你，接过账册时手指微微发抖。
<<elseif $mpTownCellarOutcome is "keep">>
	你把账册稳稳藏进自己床板的暗夹层。
<<elseif $mpTownCellarOutcome is "return">>
	你把账册放回铁皮箱，只贴身带走了那枚黄铜小钥匙。
<<elseif $mpTownCellarOutcome is "bluff">>
	贝利盯着你看了许久，最后侧身让开半步。
<<elseif $mpTownCellarOutcome is "surrender">>
	贝利把账册收进内袋，冷淡吩咐：「明晚起走廊的灯由你关。」
<<else>>
	你从煤槽爬出来时蹭了一身煤灰，贝利只在身后锁上了暗门。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[清点所得 (0:02)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Payout]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Payout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_cellar_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_hidden"] or $mpClues["town_cellar_names"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_receipts"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_school"] or $mpClues["town_cellar_temple"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_cellar_sera"] or $mpClues["town_cellar_bluff"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownCellarOutcome is "robin" or $mpTownCellarOutcome is "keep">><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($willpower or 0), ($english or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2400>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1800>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1300>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 900>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownCellarOutcome is "surrender" or $mpTownCellarOutcome is "caught">><<set _reward to Math.floor(_reward / 2)>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownCellarOutcome isnot "surrender" and $mpTownCellarOutcome isnot "caught">>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_cellar_complete")>>
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
	<</if>>
	你把能从地窖账册里对上的名字逐一抄在薄纸上。
<<else>>
	你凭记忆默下了几个被涂黑一半的名字，留作日后查证。
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
	你从暗门后的旧账夹层里拿到约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 应急银币。
	<<money _reward>><<stress -6>><<trauma -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你又把抄下的薄纸翻看了一遍，确认先前记下的名字分毫不差。
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[核对账页 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestAttic or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	天花板角落的活板门今天比平时沉。
你一拉麻绳，细灰就簌簌落下来。阁楼里很安静，只有风从瓦缝里挤过去的轻响。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>说过，这间房以前住过一个叫玛拉的女孩。她走的那天，只带走了一只小箱子。
	<br><br>
		<<sneakicon>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<link [[趁夜开活板门 (0:06)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<pass 6>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<set $mpQuestAttic to 1>><<set $mpTownAtticNight to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpQuestAttic to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>><</if>><</link>><<else>><<link [[趁夜开活板门 (0:06)|MP NotNow]]>><<set $mpNotNowRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpNotNowLabel to "趁夜开活板门">><<set $mpNotNowReq to "夜晚 或 黄昏">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[直接拽开活板门 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestAttic to 1>><<set $mpTownAtticHaste to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>><<pass 4>><<stress 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[敲敲横梁 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestAttic to 1>><<set $mpTownAtticKnock to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	阁楼的木梯已经放下来，灰尘在斜射的光里慢慢飘。
	<br><br>
		<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬上去 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	旧皮箱还搁在房梁下面，铜锁链上有一层新蹭掉的灰。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[回到箱旁 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
	日记摊在你膝头。纸页间的潮气已经散了，字迹却比刚才更清楚。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[再读日记 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
	日记最后一页夹着一张折过的草图，边角磨得发毛。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[展开草图 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	楼梯上传来脚步声。活板门还开着一条缝。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[躲到梁后 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	你把能找到的东西都收在怀里。楼下的人已经走到走廊尽头。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[钻下活板门 (0:01)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	阁楼里只剩一层薄灰和空箱子。玛拉留下的东西已经不在原处。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[回看空箱 (0:03)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<link [[返回卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 2)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
阁楼比你想的矮。斜屋顶下堆着旧衣架、断了腿的椅子，还有一只缠着铜锁链的皮箱。箱盖上落着一层灰，灰上有几道新鲜的指印。
<<if $mpTownAtticHaste is 1>>
	你上来得太急，肩膀撞到横梁，一片灰落进领口。
	<<pain 1>><<stress 1>>
<<elseif $mpTownAtticKnock is 1>>
	你敲过的那根横梁是空的。里面有什么东西轻轻滚了一下，又停住。
<</if>>
<br><br>
皮箱的锁是老式的，锁孔里没有钥匙。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-bedroom-attic-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "稳住心神 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-bedroom-attic-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 240>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_attic_lock"]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_lock"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你用发卡拨开锁舌，铜链滑落时只发出很轻的一声。
	<<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
<<link [[打开皮箱 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownAtticStuck to 1>>
	发卡在锁孔里折断了。你用力扯了一下铜链，箱子纹丝不动，楼下却传来一声开门响。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 1>>
	<br><br>
<<link [[蛮力撬锁 (0:07)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpTownAtticForce to 1>><<stress 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<<link [[下楼找工具 (0:06)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpTownAtticTool to 1>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<<link [[俯身再稳住心神 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[稳住心神 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "稳住心神">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
皮箱里铺着一层褪色的天鹅绒。上面放着一本硬皮日记、一只银顶针，还有一束用红线扎着的干花。
日记的扉页写着「玛拉·W」，下面有一行被水洇开的字：『如果我没回来，别让他们把井填上。』
<<if $mpTownAtticForce is 1>>
	锁扣被你撬弯了，箱盖边缘留下一道新痕。你尽量把痕迹按回原样。
	<<stress 2>>
<<elseif $mpTownAtticTool is 1>>
	你从楼下工具箱里找到一把小撬棍，箱盖开得很干净。
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_lock"]>><span class="teal">箱锁簧片被你无声拨开，天鹅绒衬垫下的旧物完好地露了出来。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link [[读日记 (0:08)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step4]]>><<pass 8>><<if (($english or 0) + ($mpClues["town_attic_lock"] ? 60 : 0)) gte 280 or ($history or 0) gte 280>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_attic_mara"]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_mara"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTownAtticSketchMiss to 1>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>><<else>><<link [[读日记 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "读日记">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<link [[看银顶针 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step4]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_attic_thimble"]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_thimble"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_mara"]>>
	日记断断续续。玛拉写过洗衣房、写过冬天的热水，也写过一个总在花园枯井边等她的男人。最后一页只有一句话：『他给我的齿轮不是纪念品，是钥匙。』
<<else>>
	你没完全读懂那些字。但画很直白：一口井，井壁上有七道横刻；井底旁边画着一只带齿的小圆盘。
<</if>>
你把日记翻到中间，发现装订线被拆开过。线缝里夹着一片薄铜片，上面刻着和钟表铺橱窗里那只怀表相同的星象刻度。
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_thimble"]>><span class="teal">你对照银顶针内侧镌刻的缩写，一眼认出了日记末页提到的暗记。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[抽出铜片 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_attic_gear"]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_gear"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[翻到末页 (0:06)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_attic_well"]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_well"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[合上日记 (0:03)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<set $mpTownAtticMercy to 1>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_well"]>>
	草图上的井就在孤儿院后花园。井壁七道横刻，对应七块松动的砖。玛拉在角落写了「第三块」。
<<else>>
	铜片背面刻着一串很小的数字，像是钟表铺的零件编号。你把它翻过来时，边缘割了一下指腹。
	<<pain 1>>
<</if>>
楼梯上传来脚步声。这次不是路过，是有人在上楼。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-bedroom-attic-step5">
<<mpsneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "藏好日记 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-bedroom-attic-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 260>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_attic_hidden"]>><<set $mpClues["town_attic_hidden"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你把日记塞进梁上的旧衣堆，自己缩到烟囱后面的阴影里。门被推开，有人在屋里站了一会儿，又关上门走了。
	<<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
<<link [[躲进阴影 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step6]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<link [[钻下活板门 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownAtticSeen to 1>>
	你后退时踩到一块松动的木板。门下的影子停住，接着门把转动了半圈。
	<<stress 6>><<pain 1>>
	<br><br>
<<link [[挪步再藏好日记 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[藏好日记 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "藏好日记">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to Math.max(($mpQuestAttic or 0), 6)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownAtticSeen is 1>>
	门开了。站在门口的是贝利。贝利看了看你，又看了看你身后的阁楼。
	「上面不安全，」贝利说，「下来。」
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[顺从下去 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "bailey">><<pass 4>><<stress 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<<mphearticon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 250>><<link [[说找旧衣 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "bluff">><<pass 4>><<stress 2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[说找旧衣 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "说找旧衣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬出气窗 (0:07)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "roof">><<pass 7>><<pain 3>><<stress 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你把日记重新包好。楼下传来<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>的声音，<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>在喊你的名字，说厨房留了汤。
	日记最后一页的地址就在孤儿院后花园。你可以现在去，也可以把它交给别人。
	<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<link [[交给罗宾 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "robin">><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -5>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
	<br>
<<link [[留下日记 (0:04)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "keep">><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<link [[放回日记 (0:05)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownAtticOutcome to "return">><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[返回卧室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Bedroom Attic Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAttic to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAttic to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Bedroom")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Bedroom">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_attic_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_mara"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_gear"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_well"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_attic_hidden"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownAtticOutcome is "robin" or $mpTownAtticOutcome is "keep">><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($english or 0), ($history or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 650 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2100>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1600>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1200>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 800>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownAtticOutcome is "bailey" or $mpTownAtticOutcome is "roof">><<set _reward to Math.floor(_reward / 2)>><</if>>
你把活板门合上，木梯收回原位。
<<if $mpTownAtticOutcome is "robin">>
<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把日记抱在胸前，没有立刻翻开。
<<elseif $mpTownAtticOutcome is "keep">>
你把日记藏在自己的枕头下。那天夜里，你梦见一口井。
<<elseif $mpTownAtticOutcome is "return">>
皮箱重新合上，铜链绕回原来的位置。
<<elseif $mpTownAtticOutcome is "bailey">>
贝利没有碰箱子，只让你下楼。第二天阁楼多了一把新锁，钥匙不在你手里。
<<elseif $mpTownAtticOutcome is "roof">>
你从气窗翻到屋檐上，顺着排水管滑下去。手掌磨破了，但日记还在怀里。
<<else>>
你含糊地说了句找旧衣服。贝利看了你一会儿，转身下楼。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownAtticOutcome isnot "bailey">>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_attic_complete")>>
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
	<</if>>
	<<if $mpClues["town_attic_gear"] and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_attic_gear")>>
		<<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	你只来得及藏起那束干花。日记留在了箱子里。
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从这只旧箱子里得到约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
你把日记重新翻了一遍，箱底已经没有新的东西。
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回看活板门 (0:03)|MP Quest Bedroom Attic]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalertinit "school">><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestClocktower or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	钟表旧货铺的门铃响了一声。
满墙挂钟各走各的，滴答声挤在一起。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>站在柜台后面，正用一块麂皮擦镜片。
	「别碰那只，」她头也不抬，「它走得比谁都准，只是不肯走。」
	<br><br>
	<<mpclockworkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[问怀表来历 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<set $mpTownClockSera to 1>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[看零件匣 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<set $mpTownClockParts to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<pass 5>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "翻动零件匣">>
	<br>
	<<if ($money or 0) gte 300>><<shopicon>><<link [[买旧齿轮 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<set $mpTownClockBought to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower to 1>><<pass 4>><<money -300>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买旧齿轮 (0:04)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	怀表还在柜台角落。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把镜片夹回眼前，假装没在看你。
	<br><br>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[回到柜台 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	你已经把怀表的后盖撬松了一条缝。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>去了里间找零件。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[看表芯 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
	怀表上的铭文已经很清楚了。钟塔的报时声从街口传来。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[去钟塔 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
	钟塔基座后面的石阶还在。铁栅上挂着新锁。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[靠近铁栅 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	暗格里的黄铜发条匣已经露出来。街口有人朝这边走。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[取出匣子 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	发条匣在你怀里轻轻发烫。钟塔顶上的铜针还在转。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[返回钟表铺 (0:01)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	钟表铺的怀表已经被你查清。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把它收回柜台，指针依然停在十二点零五分。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[回看怀表 (0:03)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 2)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockSera is 1>>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把怀表翻过来，指着底盖边缘一道极细的撬痕。
	「有人开过它，没开完。」她说，「里面的音簧不是原配。你听。」
	她把表贴到你耳边。你听见一声很轻的嗡鸣，像很远的地方有人在敲钟。
<<elseif $mpTownClockParts is 1>>
	零件匣里全是拆下来的旧齿轮。你翻到最下面，摸到一只比别的都薄的黄铜片，边缘刻着钟塔的轮廓。
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_parts"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_parts"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>收下钱，从柜台底下摸出一只旧齿轮推给你：「拿去玩。别把表拆了。」
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_spare"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_spare"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-highstreet-clockshop-step2">
<<mptranslateicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "读铭文 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_latin"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_latin"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-highstreet-clockshop-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 260>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_open"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_open"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你用薄刃沿撬痕轻轻一挑，底盖弹开。表芯里多出一层夹底，夹底上刻着一行拉丁文。
	<<stress -1>><<mpalert 8>><<mpalertgain "撬动表盖">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[记下铭文 (0:07)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_latin"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_latin"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 7>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "纸笔窸窣">>
	<br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[请塞拉看 (0:06)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_sera_read"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_sera_read"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<stress -1>><<mpalert -12>><</link>><<mpalertloss "塞拉引开注意">><<else>><</if>>
	<br>
<<link [[量齿轮间距 (0:06)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_measure"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_measure"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "齿轮碰撞">>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownClockScratch to 1>>
	薄刃滑了一下，在你虎口划出一道细口。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>抬头看了一眼，没说话，只把放大镜往你这边推了推。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 2>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "薄刃滑脱">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[垫布再读铭文 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[读铭文 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "读铭文">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_latin"] or $mpClues["town_clock_sera_read"]>>
	铭文的意思是「正午之后，第五分钟归塔」。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>说，这是旧钟塔建成时的校准语，知道它的人不超过三个。
<<else>>
	你没读懂那行字，但齿轮的咬合间距和钟塔外壁的浮雕刻度一模一样。你数出七个齿距，正好对应塔基的七块条石。
<</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把怀表收回绒布上，忽然说：「今晚塔里有人换班。你要去，就别走正门。」
她没问你去干什么。
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_measure"] or $mpClues["town_clock_parts"] or $mpClues["town_clock_spare"]>><span class="teal">对照先前量出的怀表夹底齿距与备件规格，你看懂了这句校准铭文的用意。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_tower"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_tower"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<link [[趁夜去钟塔 (0:08)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4]]>><<pass 8>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着钟塔墙根">><<else>><<link [[趁夜去钟塔 (0:08)|MP NotNow]]>><<set $mpNotNowRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpNotNowLabel to "趁夜去钟塔">><<set $mpNotNowReq to "夜晚 或 黄昏">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[请塞拉同去 (0:09)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4]]>><<set $mpTownClockSeraHelp to 1>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 1>><</if>><<pass 9>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -12>><</link>><<mpalertloss "塞拉望风引开注意">><<else>><</if>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
钟塔基座后面的石阶被铁栅封着。锁是新的，锁孔里却有一点点旧油。
<<if $mpTownClockSeraHelp is 1>>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>站在街角替你望风，围巾遮住半张脸。她朝铁栅抬了抬下巴，示意你快一点。
<<else>>
	街口的路灯把铁栅的影子拉得很长。远处有巡夜的脚步声，规律地靠近。
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_tower"]>><span class="teal">顺着<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>指点的钟塔侧巷望去，铁栅锁孔里那点旧表油清晰可辨。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-highstreet-clockshop-step4">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link "推门进去 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-highstreet-clockshop-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_gate"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_gate"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	锁舌弹开，铁栅只响了一声。你侧身钻进去，把铁栅虚掩回原位。
	<<stress 1>><<mpalert 8>><<mpalertgain "锁舌弹响">>
石阶向下，转了两个弯，停在一扇包铁木门前。门缝里透出暖黄的光。
	<br><br>
<<link [[走进塔内 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step5]]>><<pass 5>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "钻进铁栅">>
	<br>
<<link [[听里面动静 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step5]]>><<set $mpTownClockListen to 1>><<pass 4>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "屏息听门内">>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownClockAlarm to 1>>
	锁芯卡了一下，铁栅撞在石阶上，声音在塔基里来回撞。巡夜的脚步立刻停了。
	<<stress 5>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "铁栅撞响">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[按稳再推门进去 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[推门进去 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "推门进去">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
门后是一间圆形的机括室。墙上的铜管一根根伸进石壁，中央的控制盘上嵌着七个可以按下的黄铜键。控制盘下方有一块活动的浮雕石砖，边缘磨得发亮。
<<if $mpTownClockListen is 1>>
	你听见铜管里有人在说话，声音很小，像从很远的地方传过来。其中一个说「第五分钟」，另一个说「别让<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>知道」。
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_voice"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_voice"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<elseif $mpTownClockAlarm is 1>>
	上面的铁栅又响了一下。有人在塔外停住了。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 280 or ($science or 0) gte 280>><<link [[校准铜键 (0:08)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step6]]>><<pass 8>><<mpalert 8>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 300 or ($science or 0) gte 300>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_calibrate"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_calibrate"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTownClockSlow to 1>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铜管低鸣">><<else>><<link [[校准铜键 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "校准铜键">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬开石砖 (0:06)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step6]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_brick"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_brick"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "石砖摩擦">>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to Math.max(($mpQuestClocktower or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
石砖弹开，里面是一只黄铜发条匣。匣盖上刻着和怀表夹底一样的拉丁文。你把它捧出来时，整间机括室的铜管同时低鸣了一声。
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_voice"]>>
	铜管里的声音停了。片刻后，有人从塔上往下走。
<<else>>
	塔顶的钟忽然敲了一下。不是整点。
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_brick"]>><span class="teal">循着中空石砖后传来的擒纵轻响，你稳稳捧出了那只黄铜发条匣。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[带匣退走 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownClockOutcome to "leave">><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "抱匣下楼">>
<br>
<<mptranslateicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link [[抄下铭文 (0:07)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownClockOutcome to "copy">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_clock_copy"]>><<set $mpClues["town_clock_copy"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 7>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "纸笔窸窣">><<else>><<link [[抄下铭文 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "抄下铭文">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[放回匣子 (0:05)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownClockOutcome to "return">><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><<mpalert -8>><</link>><<mpalertloss "抹去指纹">>
<br>
<<if $mpTownClockSeraHelp is 1>>
	<<sneakicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[交给塞拉 (0:04)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownClockOutcome to "sera">><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -12>><</link>><<mpalertloss "塞拉引开注意">><<else>><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestClocktower to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_clock_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_open"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_latin"] or $mpClues["town_clock_sera_read"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_gate"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_voice"] or $mpClues["town_clock_calibrate"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome is "copy" or $mpTownClockOutcome is "sera">><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($maths or 0), ($science or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2400>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1800>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1300>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 900>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome is "return">><<set _reward += 300>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome is "sera">><<set _reward += 200>><</if>>
你回到高街时，钟塔的指针已经走过了十二点零五分。
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome is "leave">>
你没把发条匣拿出来。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>看了你一眼，什么也没问。
<<elseif $mpTownClockOutcome is "copy">>
你把抄下的铭文摊在柜台上。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>用放大镜看了一遍，手指在「第五分钟」几个字上停了很久。
<<elseif $mpTownClockOutcome is "return">>
发条匣回到石砖后面。钟塔的铜管在你离开时轻轻响了一声，像有人松了一口气。
<<elseif $mpTownClockOutcome is "sera">>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把发条匣收进柜台下的铁盒，又把钥匙放进自己围裙口袋。
<<else>>
你从塔里出来时，街口的巡夜人已经走了。发条匣在怀里一下一下地轻震，像一颗很小的心。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownClockOutcome isnot "return" and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_clock_complete")>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_clock_open"] and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_clock_gear")>>
	<<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从钟塔的暗格里得到约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
你再次检查发条匣，里面只剩先前抄过的铭文。
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<<if $mpClues["town_clock_copy"]>><span class="teal">口袋里那纸拓印完好的拉丁铭文与齿比草图，足够<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>复原整组机芯。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回看钟塔 (0:03)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalertinit "docks">><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestSmuggler or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
<<if Time.dayState is "dusk" or Time.dayState is "night">>傍晚的港口飘着柴油和咸鱼混在一起的味道。<<else>>海风吹拂的港口飘着柴油和咸鱼混在一起的味道。<</if>>
一个穿短打的男人正蹲在箱边，用粉笔在箱角画记号。
	<br><br>
		<<sneakicon>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<link [[跟上去看 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<set $mpTownDocksFollow to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着集装箱跟踪">><<else>><<link [[跟上去看 (0:06)|MP NotNow]]>><<set $mpNotNowRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpNotNowLabel to "跟上去看">><<set $mpNotNowReq to "夜晚 或 黄昏">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($money or 0) gte 100>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[找码头工 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<set $mpTownDocksAsk to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<pass 5>><<money -100>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">找码头工 (0:05)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬上箱顶 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<set $mpTownDocksClimb to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestSmuggler to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 2>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "爬上箱顶">>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	集装箱后面的粉笔记号还没有被擦掉。海风把防雨布吹得啪啪响。
	<br><br>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[回到箱后 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	你已经记住了记号的样子。值班室的灯在栈桥尽头亮着。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[去值班室 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
	值班室的窗台上摊着一本货单。外面传来夜航船的汽笛。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[翻货单 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
	夜航船靠上了三号泊位。跳板还没放稳，已经有人开始往下搬东西。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[靠近三号泊位 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	底舱的灯灭了。你听见有人在里面低声说话。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[摸到底舱 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	你带着货单和底舱里看到的东西退到栈桥阴影里。探照灯正朝这边扫过来。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[走栈桥离开 (0:01)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	三号泊位的夜航船已经离港。集装箱后面的粉笔记号被雨水冲淡了。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[回看泊位 (0:03)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 2)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksFollow is 1>>
你贴着集装箱的阴影跟了半条栈桥。男人在第三只箱子前停下，用鞋尖踢了踢箱底。
	他走开后，你在箱角看见一个三角形加两道水波纹的记号，和货单上印的普通咸鱼标记不一样。
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_mark"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_mark"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<elseif $mpTownDocksAsk is 1>>
老码头工收了你的钱，往手心啐了一口，压低声音说：「三角加水波，是夜航船的私货。」
	他指了指值班室：「货单在窗台上，自己去瞧。」
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_mark"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_mark"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<else>>
你爬上集装箱顶，从防雨布的破口往下看。男人在箱角画完记号，又从怀里摸出一张折过的纸。
	你记住了纸角露出的半个船名：白鸥。
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_mark"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_mark"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<stress 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-docks-smuggler-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link "去查货单 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-docks-smuggler-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 220>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_seal"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_seal"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你用刀尖挑开箱角的一块铅封，里面塞着防潮的油纸。
	<<stress -1>><<mpalert 8>><<mpalertgain "铅封撬响">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[溜进值班室 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step3]]>><<pass 6>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着墙根">>
	<br>
<<link [[躲开喊话人 (0:04)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step3]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "缩进缆绳阴影">>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownDocksNoise to 1>>
	铅封比你想的硬。刀尖一滑，在箱面上划出一道白痕。栈桥那头有人喊了一声。
	<<stress 4>><<pain 1>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "刀尖划响箱面">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[沉肩再去查货单 (0:04)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[去查货单 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "去查货单">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
值班室的门没锁。屋里只有一张桌子、一只铁皮柜和一盏罩着报纸的灯。货单摊在窗台上，最上面一页写着「咸鱼、绳具、空桶」。
你翻到第二页，箱号、重量和泊位时间都对得上，唯独三号泊位那一栏的收货人写着「代收」。
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_mark"]>>
	「代收」旁边的记号，和你在集装箱上看到的一模一样。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[核对重量 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step4]]>><<pass 6>><<mpalert 8>><<if (($maths or 0) + ($mpClues["town_docks_mark"] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_weight"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_weight"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set $mpTownDocksNumbersMiss to 1>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>><<mpalertgain "翻动货单">><<else>><<link [[核对重量 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "核对重量">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[翻铁皮柜 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step4]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_ledger"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_ledger"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<stress 2>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "柜门吱呀">>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
夜航船靠上三号泊位时，栈桥上的灯只亮了一半。跳板搭稳后，两个水手先下去，第三个人留在船头，手里提着一盏蒙布的风灯。
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_weight"]>>
	货单上的重量比咸鱼该有的重了将近三倍。你几乎能确定，底舱里装的是别的东西。
<<else>>
	你抄下的箱号里，有三个不在今晚的卸货清单上。
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_ledger"]>><span class="teal">你对照铁皮柜底单上的三组吃水编号，在三号泊位准确认出了那艘夜航船。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬上船尾 (0:08)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_board"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_board"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 8>><<stress 3>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "攀上船尾">>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[借吊影靠近 (0:07)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_shadow"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_shadow"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 7>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "借吊影潜行">>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[通知巡港 (0:09)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5]]>><<set $mpTownDocksPatrol to 1>><<pass 9>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -12>><</link>><<mpalertloss "巡港引开注意">>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksPatrol is 1>>
	巡港的老水手听你说完，只问了一句「三号泊位？」就吹响了哨子。栈桥上立刻乱起来，夜航船开始收跳板。
	你趁乱从船尾翻上去，底舱门没锁。
<<else>>
	你从船尾摸上甲板，顺着货舱口的铁梯往下。底舱里点着一盏风灯，灯下堆着没有标记的木箱，箱子后面传来很轻的咳嗽声。
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_board"] or $mpClues["town_docks_shadow"]>><span class="teal">借着跳板与货堆阴影的掩护，你在栈桥哨声响起时已摸进了底舱。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
箱子后面绑着一个人。嘴被布条勒住，手腕上留着绳印。那人看见你时，眼睛先是一亮，接着拼命摇头，示意你别出声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回甲板 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[割开麻绳 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6]]>><<set $mpTownDocksFree to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_captive"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_captive"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "屏息割绳">>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[翻箱找货单 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_manifest"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_manifest"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "翻箱窸窣">>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[挪开箱子 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6]]>><<set $mpTownDocksBox to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 2>><<mpalert 12>><</link>><<mpalertgain "木箱拖响">>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to Math.max(($mpQuestSmuggler or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksFree is 1>>
	布条松开后，那人咳了很久才说出话。那人是前一条夜航船的记账员，因为看见不该看的货单被关在这里。
	「三号舱底有夹层，」那人抓着你的手腕，「他们今晚要转船。你要么现在走，要么跟我一起把夹层打开。」
<<elseif $mpClues["town_docks_manifest"]>>
	你在箱底翻出一本浸过油的货单。最后一页写着「转船：白鸥—雾角」，下面是一串人名，其中两个被红笔圈过。
<<else>>
	你挪开箱子，后面是一块活动的舱板。板下藏着几只皮袋和一把带海盐的短刀。
<</if>>
<br><br>
甲板上传来脚步声。有人正在往下走。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回甲板 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-docks-smuggler-step6">
<<mpsneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link "灭灯躲箱后 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-docks-smuggler-step6">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_docks_escape"]>><<set $mpClues["town_docks_escape"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你灭掉风灯，把舱门虚掩，拉着那人躲进空箱后面。下来的人踢了两脚箱子，骂了一句，又上去了。
	<<stress 2>><<mpalert -8>><<mpalertloss "熄灭风灯">><<mpalert -5>><<mpalertloss "躲进空箱后">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[带人下船 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "free">><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "沿阴影下船">>
	<br>
	<<link [[带货单离开 (0:04)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "evidence">><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着货堆离开">>
	<br>
<<link [[封好夹层 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "seal">><<pass 6>><<stress -3>><<mpalert -8>><</link>><<mpalertloss "抹平粉笔灰">>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownDocksCaught to 1>>
	风灯被你不小心碰倒。灯油泼在木板上，火苗窜起来，甲板上的人立刻朝舱口跑来。
	<<stress 7>><<pain 2>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "风灯翻倒">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[反锁舱门 (0:04)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "lock">><<pass 4>><<stress 2>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "反锁舱门">>
	<br>
<<link [[跳海逃生 (0:06)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "sea">><<pass 6>><<pain 3>><<stress 4>><<mpalert 12>><</link>><<mpalertgain "撞翻木桶">>
	<br>
<<link [[举货单谈判 (0:05)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownDocksOutcome to "deal">><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><<mpalert -10>><</link>><<mpalertloss "装成收货人">>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[灭灯躲箱后 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "灭灯躲箱后">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Docks Smuggler Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestSmuggler to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestSmuggler to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_docks_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_mark"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_seal"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_weight"] or $mpClues["town_docks_ledger"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_captive"] or $mpClues["town_docks_manifest"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_escape"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($athletics or 0), ($maths or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2600>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1900>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1400>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 950>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksOutcome is "deal" or $mpTownDocksOutcome is "sea">><<set _reward to Math.floor(_reward / 2)>><</if>>
你从栈桥阴影里退出来时，三号泊位的灯还亮着。
<<if $mpTownDocksOutcome is "free">>
被你解开绳子的人混在卸货工里下了船。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "evidence">>
	你只带了货单。底舱里的咳嗽声在你离开后停了很久，又轻轻响起来。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "seal">>
你把夹层重新封好，连箱角的粉笔灰都抹平了。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "lock">>
你把舱门反锁，听着外面的人撞了两下门。底舱里的人还在。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "sea">>
海水比你想的冷。你从防波堤的石阶爬上来时，货单已经湿透。
<<elseif $mpTownDocksOutcome is "deal">>
你把货单举到灯下，对方看了一眼。你没问底舱里的人怎么办，对方也没说。
<<else>>
	你趁乱从船尾滑下去，底舱里的声音被海浪盖住。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownDocksOutcome isnot "deal" and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_docks_complete")>>
	<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_docks_captive"] and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_docks_ring")>>
	<<set $mpFragSmugglerRing to ($mpFragSmugglerRing or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从这次夜航里得到约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
三号泊位已经换了船，你手里只剩上次抄下的货单。
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回看泊位 (0:03)|MP Quest Docks Smuggler]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest School Archives [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalertinit "school">><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestLibrary or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
图书馆最里侧的旧档案架下积着一层薄灰。<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>抱着一摞待归架的书从过道那头走来，看见你蹲在那里。
「那几册不在借阅目录里，」<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>说，「<<if mpNpcMet("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>先生每学期都会来查一次。」
	<br><br>
	<<mpreadicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<link [[问悉尼卷宗 (0:05)|MP Quest School Archives Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<set $mpTownSchoolSydney to 1>><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[抽出卷宗 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<set $mpTownSchoolSneak to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "书架后抽出卷宗">>
	<br>
		<<investigateicon>><<if Time.dayState is "day" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<link [[等到闭馆 (0:08)|MP Quest School Archives Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<set $mpTownSchoolLate to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestLibrary to 1>><<pass 8>><<stress -1>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "熄灯后蹲进阴影">><<else>><span class="disabled">等到闭馆 (0:08)（图书馆已关门）</span><</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
无编号卷宗还在档案架底层。<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>已经推着书车去了另一排。
	<br><br>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[回到架前 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step2]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
卷宗摊在阅览桌上。纸页间夹着几张没有署名的照片。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[再翻卷宗 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step3]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
装订线里那张硫酸纸图已经抽出来一半。图书馆的闭馆铃响了。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[展开图 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step4]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
图上标着图书馆与旧钟塔之间的夹墙连廊。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[去夹墙连廊 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step5]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
连廊尽头的石台上放着一只铁盒。盒盖上的校徽被人用刀划掉了。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[打开铁盒 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Step6]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
铁盒里的东西已经在你手里。走廊那头传来<<if mpNpcMet("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>先生的脚步声。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[退出连廊 (0:01)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
夹墙连廊已经被你走通。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[回看铁盒 (0:03)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

:: MP Quest School Archives Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to Math.max(($mpQuestLibrary or 0), 2)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolSydney is 1>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>把书车停在过道口，替你挡住管理员的视线。
	「我只知道一件事，」<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>低声说，「十年前有个毕业班，照片墙上没有他们。校刊里也查不到。」
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_class"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_class"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<elseif $mpTownSchoolLate is 1>>
	闭馆铃响过之后，图书馆只剩应急灯。你从档案架底层抽出卷宗，灰尘在灯下像一层细雪。
<<else>>
	你趁管理员转身，把最厚的一册卷宗抽出来。书脊裂了一道口，里面掉出半张照片。
	<<stress 1>>
<</if>>
卷宗里是十年前的教学记录。班级名单、成绩册、郊游申请都齐全，唯独毕业照那一页被整齐地撕掉了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[核对年份 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step3]]>><<pass 6>><<mpalert 8>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_year"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_year"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress -1>><</link>><<mpalertgain "翻动卷宗">><<else>><<link [[核对年份 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "核对年份">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<link [[问毕业班 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step3]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_sydney"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_sydney"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><</if>>

:: MP Quest School Archives Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to Math.max(($mpQuestLibrary or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
照片背面写着一行日期和「天文翼楼实习」。你翻遍卷宗，发现那一届的郊游申请目的地不是山里，而是旧钟塔。
「他们没去郊游，」<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>站在你身后，声音很轻，「学校把钟塔借给了一个研究小组。后来小组解散，学生也转走了。」
<<if $mpClues["town_school_sydney"]>><span class="teal">按<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>提过的旧档分类规矩，你很快从郊游卷宗里翻出了那张实习照。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[拆开装订线 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step4]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_map"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_map"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "拆线窸窣">>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<link [[问悉尼去向 (0:05)|MP Quest School Archives Step4]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_transfer"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_transfer"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[放回卷宗 (0:04)|MP Quest School Archives Step4]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolHide to 1>><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><<mpalert -8>><</link>><<mpalertloss "抹平折角">>

:: MP Quest School Archives Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to Math.max(($mpQuestLibrary or 0), 4)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
装订线里藏着一张硫酸纸图。图上标着图书馆古籍架后方与旧钟塔之间的夹墙连廊，连廊尽头画了一个小圆圈，旁边写着「禁闭室」。
<<if $mpClues["town_school_transfer"]>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>说，转走的学生里有三个后来在神殿和孤儿院的记录里出现过。你想起账册上的缩写。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<link [[进夹墙 (0:08)|MP Quest School Archives Step5]]>><<pass 8>><<mpalert 6>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_wall"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_wall"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress 2>><<else>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_wall"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_wall"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴墙钻进夹墙">><<else>><<link [[进夹墙 (0:08)|MP NotNow]]>><<set $mpNotNowRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpNotNowLabel to "进夹墙">><<set $mpNotNowReq to "夜晚 或 黄昏">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<link [[拉悉尼同去 (0:09)|MP Quest School Archives Step5]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolSydneyHelp to 1>><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>><<pass 9>><<stress -2>><<mpalert -12>><</link>><<mpalertloss "悉尼引开注意">><<else>><</if>>

:: MP Quest School Archives Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to Math.max(($mpQuestLibrary or 0), 5)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
古籍架侧面的黄铜烛台就是机关。你按图上的方向旋了半圈，书架向后让出一道只容一人侧身通过的缝。
夹墙里没有灯，空气干冷。墙皮上留着粉笔写的日期，越往里越密。尽头的石台上放着一只铁盒，盒盖上的校徽被刀划掉了。
<<if $mpTownSchoolSydneyHelp is 1>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>跟在你身后，手里举着一盏从阅览室带出来的小灯。<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>没说话，但呼吸很浅。
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_wall"]>><span class="teal">顺着刚才敲出的夹墙空响位置，你一拧黄铜烛台便让开了书架暗缝。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回图书馆 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-quest-school-archives-step5">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link "翻档案 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-school-archives-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 280>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_box"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_box"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	铁盒的锁很简单。你拨开锁舌，盒里是一叠学生档案和一把小钥匙。
	<<stress -1>><<mpalert 8>><<mpalertgain "锁扣弹开">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[取走档案 (0:06)|MP Quest School Archives Step6]]>><<pass 6>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴墙取档">>
	<br>
	<<link [[听墙外动静 (0:04)|MP Quest School Archives Step6]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolListen to 1>><<pass 4>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "屏息听墙外">>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpTownSchoolNoise to 1>>
	锁扣弹了一下，铁盒从石台上滑下去，砸在地上。声音在夹墙里传得很远。
	<<stress 5>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "铁盒坠地">>
	<br><br>
<<link [[拢袖再翻档案 (0:04)|MP Quest School Archives Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[翻档案 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "翻档案">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Quest School Archives Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to Math.max(($mpQuestLibrary or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
档案里的学生照片都被剪掉了一角。每份档案后面都附着一张转学许可，签字栏是同一个名字：L. <<if mpNpcMet("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>。
最底下压着一份没写完的报告，标题是「关于钟塔地下回声的初步记录」。最后一行只有半句：『他们不是转学，是被——』
<<if $mpTownSchoolListen is 1>>
	墙外传来<<if mpNpcMet("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>先生的声音。他在问管理员，今晚谁最后一个离开图书馆。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[带档案离开 (0:05)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolOutcome to "take">><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着走廊离开">>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link [[抄下名单 (0:07)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolOutcome to "copy">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_school_names"]>><<set $mpClues["town_school_names"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 7>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "纸笔窸窣">><<else>><<link [[抄下名单 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "抄下名单">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<link [[交给悉尼 (0:05)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolOutcome to "sydney">><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><<mpalert -12>><</link>><<mpalertloss "悉尼引开注意">><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[放回铁盒 (0:04)|MP Quest School Archives Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownSchoolOutcome to "return">><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><<mpalert -8>><</link>><<mpalertloss "抹去指纹">>
<br>
<<link [[返回图书馆 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

:: MP Quest School Archives Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpQuestLibrary to 7>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestLibrary to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "School Library")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "School Library">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_school_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_class"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_year"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_map"] or $mpClues["town_school_transfer"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_school_box"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "copy" or $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "sydney">><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($skulduggery or 0), ($history or 0), ($english or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2200>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1700>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1200>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 800>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "return">><<set _reward += 300>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "sydney">><<set _reward += 200>><</if>>
你从夹墙退回图书馆，把书架推回原位。闭馆后的走廊只剩应急灯，光从门缝里漏进来。
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "take">>
学生档案在你怀里硌得慌。你从侧门出去时，<<if mpNpcMet("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>先生正站在走廊尽头。
<<elseif $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "copy">>
你把名单抄在一张借书卡的背面。原件放回铁盒，连折角都照原样压平。
<<elseif $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "sydney">>
<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>接过档案，手指在「L. <<if mpNpcMet("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>」的签名上停了一会儿。
<<elseif $mpTownSchoolOutcome is "return">>
铁盒回到石台上。你只带走了那张硫酸纸图，图上的「禁闭室」三个字被你的指温蹭得有点模糊。
<<else>>
你从夹墙出来时，图书馆已经锁门了。你在侧门等了一会儿，才等到巡夜人经过。
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownSchoolOutcome isnot "return" and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_school_complete")>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
<<if _first>>
你从这届被抹掉的学生档案里得到约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
夹墙里的铁盒已经空了，你只又核对了一遍名单。
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>

<<if $mpClues["town_school_names"]>><span class="teal">你把铁盒里抄下的转学名单与旧档案袋逐一对上，来龙去脉已然清晰。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回看档案架 (0:03)|MP Quest School Archives]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalertinit "catacomb">><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<mplightinit>><<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestCatacomb or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
神殿侧廊的青铜烛台底座有一圈新鲜的刮痕。
	「你也听见了？」<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>问，「昨晚的钟声。不是塔上的那口。」
	<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把灯放在烛台旁边，没有点。
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>><<link [[问乔丹钟声 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<set $mpTownTempleJordan to 1>><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "跟着脚步下侧廊">><<mplightloss>><<else>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpritualicon>><<link [[转动烛台 (0:06)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<set $mpTownTempleTurn to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress 1>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "石壁摩擦">><<mplightloss>>
	<br>
	<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[留下听钟声 (0:08)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<set $mpTownTempleListen to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 8>><<stress -1>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "靠墙屏息">><<mplightloss>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	侧廊的烛台已经被你转过半圈。石壁后面的冷风从缝里渗出来。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[推开石板 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2]]>><<pass 1>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	石阶向下，尽头有一点微弱的烛光。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[走下石阶 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step3]]>><<pass 1>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<<elseif _stg is 3>>
	地下墓穴的石壁上刻满了雾月之蚀的壁画。祭台暗龛里有一只银质圣油瓶。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[走近祭台 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step4]]>><<pass 1>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<<elseif _stg is 4>>
	暗龛后面的石门开了一条缝。里面有人在低声念诵。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[靠近石门 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step5]]>><<pass 1>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	石门后的念诵停了。你听见脚步声朝门口走来。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[藏到祭台后 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<pass 1>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	地下墓穴的冷风从暗河方向吹来。你已经拿到了能拿的东西。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[退回石阶 (0:01)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<pass 1>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<<else>>
	地下墓穴已经被你走遍。祭台暗龛空着，石壁上的壁画还在烛光里发暗。
	<br><br>
		<<link [[回看壁画 (0:03)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<</if>>
<<link [[返回侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpLight to 0>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<br>
<<if $mpLightAmbush is 1>>
<<link [[扶石阶壁挡黑影 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb]]>><<pass 4>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<set $mpLightAmbush to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to Math.max(($mpQuestCatacomb or 0), 2)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 80>>
<div id="mp-catacomb-alert">
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 100>>
<strong>石阶上下都是脚步声，搜查队已经把墓道围死。</strong>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[拼死一搏 (0:06)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith]]>><<pass 6>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($english or 0), ($willpower or 0)) gte 260>><<link "虚张声势 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-catacomb-alert">>
<<set _bluff to Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($english or 0), ($willpower or 0))>><<set _bluffNeed to 300>>
<<if _bluff + random(1, 80) gte _bluffNeed>>
你抬起下巴，用神殿执事的腔调呵斥他们越权搜查。灰袍人彼此看了一眼，慢慢让开了石阶。
<<mpalert -20>><<mpalertloss "口才压过守卫">><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>>
<br><br>
<<link [[趁乱退出侧廊 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
你的声音在石阶间发虚。灰袍人没有让路，反而收紧了包围。
<<mpalert 15>><<mpalertgain "虚张声势被识破">>
<br><br>
<<link [[被搜查队押走 (0:05)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 5>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "虚张声势">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($skulduggery or 0)) gte 260>><<link "转身就跑 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-catacomb-alert">>
<<set _flee to Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($skulduggery or 0))>><<set _fleeNeed to 300>>
<<if _flee + random(1, 80) gte _fleeNeed>>
你撞开最近的火盆，趁灰烟腾起冲上石阶，一路跑回侧廊。
<<mpalertclear>>你保住了已经查到的线索，只丢下了这一趟还没拿到手的东西。
<br><br>
<<link [[撤离侧廊 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
石阶上的铜灯被撞得摇晃，你还没跑出三步就被按倒在石壁上。
<br><br>
<<link [[被拖回石牢 (0:05)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 5>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[转身就跑 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "转身就跑">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[束手就擒 (0:04)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 4>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<<else>>
<strong>灰袍人堵住了石阶，只有硬闯才能出去。</strong>
<br>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 280 or ($combat or 0) gte 260>><<link [[硬闯出去 (0:03)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "MP Quest Temple Catacomb">><</link>><<else>><<link [[硬闯出去 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "硬闯出去">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：280 或 战斗等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
<</if>>
</div>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownTempleJordan is 1>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把灯递给你，自己没有跟下来。
	「下面有一段路，灯会灭，」<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>说，「听见有人叫你名字，别应。」
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_temple_warning"]>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_warning"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<mplight 10>><<mplightgain>>
<<elseif $mpTownTempleListen is 1>>
