<<else>>
<strong>石门外的通道已被灰袍人占满，除了硬闯别无他法。</strong>
<br>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 280 or ($combat or 0) gte 260>><<link [[硬闯出去 (0:03)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "MP Quest Temple Catacomb">><</link>><<else>><<link [[硬闯出去 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "硬闯出去">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：280 或 战斗等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
<</if>>
</div>
<</if>>
石门后是一间圆形的暗室，地上刻着一圈名字。七个穿灰袍的人围着圈站，脸都藏在兜帽里。他们念的不是祷词，是名字。
念到第三个名字时，其中一个人抬起头，朝门缝这边看过来。
<br><br>
<<if $mpTownTempleHide is 1>>
	你缩在祭台后面，听见灰袍人开始往门口走。脚步很慢，但没有停。
<<else>>
	你和那个抬头的人对上了视线。那人没有喊，只是抬起手，朝你招了招。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 80 or $mpLightAmbush isnot 1>><<getouticon>><<link [[返回侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpLight to 0>><<mpalertclear>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 100>><<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[站着不动 (0:06)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<pass 6>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_temple_stand"]>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_stand"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<stress 2>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<br>
<<link [[退到石门 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<set $mpTownTempleRetreat to 1>><<pass 5>><<stress 3>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "退回石门阴影">><<mplightloss>>
<br>
<<link [[问他们是谁 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_temple_ask"]>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_ask"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "开口试探">><<mplightloss>><</if>>

<br>
<<if $mpLightAmbush is 1>>
<<link [[贴侧廊壁避黑影 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step5]]>><<pass 4>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<set $mpLightAmbush to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to Math.max(($mpQuestCatacomb or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 80>>
<div id="mp-catacomb-alert">
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 100>>
<strong>暗室各处的铁栅接连落下，搜查队的脚步声已逼至近前。</strong>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[拼死一搏 (0:06)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith]]>><<pass 6>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($english or 0), ($willpower or 0)) gte 260>><<link "虚张声势 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-catacomb-alert">>
<<set _bluff to Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($english or 0), ($willpower or 0))>><<set _bluffNeed to 300>>
<<if _bluff + random(1, 80) gte _bluffNeed>>
你迎着火光念出半句古教团箴言，喝令他们退守外廊。灰袍人神色微变，默然退向石门外。
<<mpalert -20>><<mpalertloss "口才压过守卫">><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>>
<br><br>
<<link [[趁乱退出侧廊 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
你的箴言念错了尾音，灰袍人不再多言，呈半月形朝你逼近。
<<mpalert 15>><<mpalertgain "虚张声势被识破">>
<br><br>
<<link [[被搜查队押走 (0:05)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 5>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "虚张声势">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($skulduggery or 0)) gte 260>><<link "转身就跑 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-catacomb-alert">>
<<set _flee to Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($skulduggery or 0))>><<set _fleeNeed to 300>>
<<if _flee + random(1, 80) gte _fleeNeed>>
你抓起石案上的冷灰扬向火把，趁暗室陷入昏黑时顺着墙根疾奔逃出。
<<mpalertclear>>你贴身收好了关键证据全身而退，只放弃了暗室里最后那点战利品。
<br><br>
<<link [[撤离侧廊 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
暗室地面的凹槽绊得你身形一歪，几名灰袍人立刻扑上来扣住了你的手腕。
<br><br>
<<link [[被拖回石牢 (0:05)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 5>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[转身就跑 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "转身就跑">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[束手就擒 (0:04)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 4>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<<else>>
<strong>暗室去路已被灰袍守卫截断，不硬闯出去就会被彻底困死。</strong>
<br>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 280 or ($combat or 0) gte 260>><<link [[硬闯出去 (0:03)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalertclear>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "MP Quest Temple Catacomb">><</link>><<else>><<link [[硬闯出去 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "硬闯出去">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：280 或 战斗等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
<</if>>
</div>
<</if>>
<<if $mpTownTempleLocked is 1>>
	石门在你身后合上了。暗室里没有风，烛火却一起矮了下去。灰袍人没有靠近，只是继续念名字。
	你听见自己的名字被夹在中间，念得很轻，像怕惊动什么。
	<br><br>
	<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 100>><<mpritualicon>><<link [[跟着念诵 (0:06)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "pray">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_temple_pray"]>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_pray"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "跟着念诵混过去">><<mplightloss>>
	<br>
	<<link [[找墙缝风 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "draft">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_temple_draft"]>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_draft"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "贴墙找缝">><<mplightloss>>
	<br>
	<<link [[撬开底缝 (0:07)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "pry">><<pass 7>><<pain 3>><<stress 3>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert 12>><</link>><<mpalertgain "石底撬响">><<mplightloss>>
	<br>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>><<link [[喊乔丹名字 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "jordan">><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert -12>><</link>><<mpalertloss "乔丹引开注意">><<mplightloss>><<else>><</if>><</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $mpTownTempleRetreat is 1>>
		你沿墙退回石门，灰袍人没有追。门外的石阶上，<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>留下的灯还亮着。
	<<elseif $mpClues["town_temple_ask"]>>
		你问他们是谁。念诵停了。离你最近的人摘下兜帽，露出一张很年轻的脸。
		「我们是名字，」那人说，「被写下来，就不会散。」
	<<else>>
		你站着没动。灰袍人看了你一会儿，继续念名字。念到第七个时，暗室尽头的石门自己开了。
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 100>><<mpwatchicon>><<link [[拿走圣油瓶 (0:05)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "oil">><<pass 5>><<stress 1>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "拿起圣油瓶">><<mplightloss>>
	<br>
<<link [[抄下七个名字 (0:07)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "names">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["town_temple_names"]>><<set $mpClues["town_temple_names"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 7>><<stress -2>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "纸笔窸窣">><<mplightloss>>
	<br>
<<link [[留灯离开 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpTownTempleOutcome to "leave">><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><<mplight -5>><<mpalert -8>><</link>><<mpalertloss "抹掉足迹">><<mplightloss>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 80 or (($mpTownTempleLocked or 0) isnot 1 and $mpLightAmbush isnot 1)>><<getouticon>><<link [[返回侧廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpLight to 0>><<mpalertclear>><</link>><</if>>

<br>
<<if $mpLightAmbush is 1 and ($mpTownTempleLocked or 0) isnot 1>>
<<link [[扶铜灯座挡暗袭 (0:04)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Step6]]>><<pass 4>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<set $mpLightAmbush to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpLight to 0>>
<<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
你沿着石阶回到侧廊，把黄铜烛台转回原位。
<<if $mpTownTempleOutcome is "oil">>
	银质圣油瓶被你裹在布里，隔着布也能觉出里头的凉意。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "names">>
	你把七个名字抄在祝祷文背面，写到最末一笔时笔尖微顿。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "leave">>
	你把提灯留在祭台边，走出石门时身后的念诵声轻了一拍。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "draft">>
	你顺着墙缝冷风找到窄道，从暗河渡口方向绕回石阶。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "pry">>
	石门底部被你撬开条缝，挤出去时手背被石棱刮破一层皮。
<<elseif $mpTownTempleOutcome is "jordan">>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>的声音从石阶上方传来，灰袍人停下念诵，石门应声而开。
<<else>>
	你跟着念完最末一句，暗室烛火重亮，灰袍人逐一摘下兜帽。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[清点物证 (0:02)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Payout]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Payout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_temple_payout")>><</if>>
<<set _clues to 0>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_warning"] or $mpClues["town_temple_nerve"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_mural"] or $mpClues["town_temple_oil"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_door"] or $mpClues["town_temple_draft"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_stand"] or $mpClues["town_temple_ask"] or $mpClues["town_temple_pray"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_names"]>><<set _clues += 1>><</if>>
<<set _sk to Math.max(($willpower or 0), ($history or 0), ($english or 0))>>
<<if _sk gte 700 or _clues gte 4>><<set _reward to 2300>>
<<elseif _sk gte 450 or _clues gte 3>><<set _reward to 1750>>
<<elseif _sk gte 250 or _clues gte 2>><<set _reward to 1250>>
<<else>><<set _reward to 850>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownTempleOutcome is "pray" or $mpTownTempleOutcome is "leave">><<set _reward += 250>><</if>>
<<if $mpTownTempleOutcome isnot "oil" and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_temple_complete")>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["town_temple_mural"] and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("town_temple_page")>>
	<<set $mpFragAbyssPage to ($mpFragAbyssPage or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你在侧廊长椅旁停步，将地下墓穴的收获收拢妥当。
<<if _first>>
	你从这趟墓穴查访里得到约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 奉纳与旧银币。
	<<money _reward>><<stress -6>><<trauma -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	暗室里的灰袍人已经散去，你又核对了一遍祝祷文背面的七个名字。
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[回看烛台 (0:03)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

